00:24:22.860 --> 00:24:26.707
He invented ways to engage
in a totally different mode

00:24:29.220 --> 00:24:30.780
than how he performs.

00:24:30.780 --> 00:24:33.540
And then it subconsciously bleeds in

00:24:33.540 --> 00:24:35.850
