So I've been going to, you know,

00:28:40.560 --> 00:28:43.740
since the pandemic started winding down

00:28:43.740 --> 00:28:45.720
and we started going back to the dentist,

00:28:45.720 --> 00:28:48.480
one of my most recent
trips to the dentist-

00:28:48.480 --> 00:28:49.313
Oh.

00:28:49.313 --> 00:28:54.110
Was actually after we had
eaten that crazy sour thing

00:28:55.590 --> 00:28:57.390
on the Vanity Fair or whatever that was.

00:28:57.390 --> 00:29:00.450
That thing we shot where
we ate that sour candy

00:29:00.450 --> 00:29:02.010
that was straight malach acid.

00:29:02.010 --> 00:29:04.620
And they were like, no one
has ever kept the candy

00:29:04.620 --> 00:29:07.170
in their mouths nearly
as long as you guys did.

00:29:07.170 --> 00:29:09.405
We didn't expect you to keep
going and going and going,

00:29:09.405 --> 00:29:11.830
but you know that's what we're gonna do.

00:29:11.830 --> 00:29:13.647
We're us, man. We're freaking us.

00:29:13.647 --> 00:29:15.690
And I actually think
I did permanent damage

00:29:15.690 --> 00:29:17.220
to my enamel on my teeth.

00:29:17.220 --> 00:29:18.783
I know, we were both scared.

00:29:19.710 --> 00:29:20.543
And they noticed that.

00:29:20.543 --> 00:29:23.730
And when I'm scared, I
don't think about it.

00:29:23.730 --> 00:29:25.590
Like, something's wrong with my teeth,

00:29:25.590 --> 00:29:27.540
I'm not gonna think about this anymore.

00:29:27.540 --> 00:29:31.140
And it happened to you too and
you did the exact opposite.

00:29:31.140 --> 00:29:31.973
I took action.

00:29:31.973 --> 00:29:32.910
You took action.

00:29:32.910 --> 00:29:34.342
So I ended up getting some

00:29:34.342 --> 00:29:37.050
enamel repair toothpaste or whatever.

00:29:37.050 --> 00:29:39.300
But one of the things that
the dentist pointed out was,

00:29:39.300 --> 00:29:43.483
she was like, well the hygienist was like,

00:29:43.483 --> 00:29:46.950
she legitimately asked me,

00:29:46.950 --> 00:29:49.590
did you get your teeth shaved down?

00:29:49.590 --> 00:29:51.450
What? Like what?

00:29:51.450 --> 00:29:53.310
Like for some sort of like,

00:29:53.310 --> 00:29:56.013
you mean for like, a
religious ritual or something?

00:29:57.360 --> 00:30:02.360
She was like, your incisors
look like they're flat,

00:30:02.460 --> 00:30:03.293
they're not pointed.

00:30:03.293 --> 00:30:04.126
Do you see that?

00:30:05.802 --> 00:30:06.635
They're not-

00:30:06.635 --> 00:30:07.468
Yeah.

00:30:07.468 --> 00:30:08.301
Like your dog teeth, right?

00:30:08.301 --> 00:30:10.020
Like your eye teeth they call 'em.

00:30:10.020 --> 00:30:11.790
Yours are pointed and
mine used to be pointed.

00:30:11.790 --> 00:30:13.230
Mine are very pointed.

00:30:13.230 --> 00:30:14.520
And so they were like,

00:30:14.520 --> 00:30:16.230
well you're obviously
grinding your teeth at night.

00:30:16.230 --> 00:30:17.310
So I went through the whole thing

00:30:17.310 --> 00:30:19.740
of getting the mouth guard at night,

00:30:19.740 --> 00:30:22.230
which I now have and which I do wear.

00:30:22.230 --> 00:30:24.630
But I was like, I don't think
I grind my teeth at night,

00:30:24.630 --> 00:30:27.033
but you don't really
know cause you're asleep.

00:30:28.590 --> 00:30:31.050
And then I started realizing

00:30:31.050 --> 00:30:35.700
that every time in my
life for the past 45 years

00:30:35.700 --> 00:30:39.120
in which I have been
doing something intensely,

00:30:39.120 --> 00:30:40.563
I grit up my teeth like this.

00:30:40.563 --> 00:30:43.800
I've put my lower teeth
over my upper teeth,

00:30:43.800 --> 00:30:45.510
my bottom teeth come out.

00:30:45.510 --> 00:30:46.740
My dad does the same thing.

00:30:46.740 --> 00:30:48.090
It's just like this.

00:30:48.090 --> 00:30:51.240
So like, if any sports moment in my life,

00:30:51.240 --> 00:30:53.070
you'll see it even when
I like throw a dart

00:30:53.070 --> 00:30:55.143
on Good Mythical Morning like-

00:30:55.143 --> 00:30:56.580
I do.

00:30:56.580 --> 00:30:57.619
Oh wow.

00:30:57.619 --> 00:31:00.478
And I've just been doing this all my life

00:31:00.478 --> 00:31:03.070
and I do it when I lift weights

00:31:04.020 --> 00:31:06.150
and I've been doing it when
I lift weights forever.

00:31:06.150 --> 00:31:07.980
And I started reading about people

00:31:07.980 --> 00:31:10.740
who do weird things with their
teeth when they lift weights

00:31:10.740 --> 00:31:13.920
and I've been damaging my teeth for years.

00:31:13.920 --> 00:31:15.730
And in fact, last time
I went to the dentist,

00:31:15.730 --> 00:31:18.300
she was pointing at those teeth

00:31:18.300 --> 00:31:19.380
and she was like, you're basically down

00:31:19.380 --> 00:31:20.880
to the pulp on those teeth.

00:31:20.880 --> 00:31:22.625
Like you don't have anything else left

00:31:22.625 --> 00:31:24.300
protecting those teeth.

00:31:24.300 --> 00:31:27.630
So I'm probably gonna have to
get like crowns or something,

00:31:27.630 --> 00:31:29.340
like fake teeth at some point in my life.

00:31:29.340 --> 00:31:30.600
I know a guy.

00:31:30.600 --> 00:31:35.600
But in the meantime, of course,

00:31:35.880 --> 00:31:38.970
anyone who seriously, and I
don't seriously lift weights,

00:31:38.970 --> 00:31:42.633
I just lift weights for
ongoing health, you know.

00:31:43.770 --> 00:31:44.603
Oh, so I thought you would say

00:31:44.603 --> 00:31:46.260
you were gonna sleep with it.

00:31:46.260 --> 00:31:47.093
No.

00:31:47.093 --> 00:31:48.090
You lift weights with a mouth guard.

00:31:48.090 --> 00:31:49.830
I have a sleeping mouth guard,

00:31:49.830 --> 00:31:51.090
which is a completely different thing.

00:31:51.090 --> 00:31:52.560
This is like an athletic mouth guard

00:31:52.560 --> 00:31:55.440
that like Steph Curry wears
when he plays basketball.

00:31:55.440 --> 00:31:58.860
And so because biting down
when you're lifting weights

00:31:58.860 --> 00:32:01.560
is actually like scientifically proven

00:32:01.560 --> 00:32:03.960
to give you a certain
percentage increase in strength

00:32:03.960 --> 00:32:05.843
just because it's
something about, you know-

00:32:07.470 --> 00:32:08.490
And which totally makes sense

00:32:08.490 --> 00:32:09.810
because that's why when you're really

00:32:09.810 --> 00:32:11.490
trying to do something, you bite down

00:32:11.490 --> 00:32:12.840
and I would bite down like,

00:32:13.923 --> 00:32:17.340
and I've been just ripping
these teeth apart for years.

00:32:17.340 --> 00:32:18.960
So anyway, I've stopped the damage now

00:32:18.960 --> 00:32:20.793
and I work out with a mouth guard.

00:32:21.660 --> 00:32:24.510
And I encourage you if you
lift weights on a regular basis

00:32:24.510 --> 00:32:26.460
or do anything physically active.

00:32:26.460 --> 00:32:27.840
That's interesting.

00:32:27.840 --> 00:32:29.740
Get a mouth card. You might as well.

00:32:31.890 --> 00:32:33.330
Cherry pig.

00:32:33.330 --> 00:32:37.770
Solar mole repellent,
ultrasonic mole repellent,

00:32:37.770 --> 00:32:40.320
solar powered, outdoor waterproof,

00:32:40.320 --> 00:32:43.830
ultrasonic snake repellent,
for get rid of mole,

00:32:43.830 --> 00:32:48.420
gopher snakes, vole and
other underground pest.

00:32:48.420 --> 00:32:49.263
Four pack.

00:32:50.520 --> 00:32:51.747
Pretty obvious, right?

00:32:51.747 --> 00:32:54.150
I'm actually surprised that
it says snake repellent.

00:32:54.150 --> 00:32:56.490
I love that. So I got four of these-

00:32:56.490 --> 00:32:59.560
I had some of these and
I got rid of my moles

00:33:01.140 --> 00:33:02.520
in my yard, not on my skin.

00:33:02.520 --> 00:33:03.510
Yeah, right. Yeah, yeah.

00:33:03.510 --> 00:33:05.892
Some people have bought mole repellent

00:33:05.892 --> 00:33:07.860
thinking that they can
rub it on themselves.

00:33:07.860 --> 00:33:11.035
Yeah. This is like a steak
that you put in the ground.

00:33:11.035 --> 00:33:13.126
It's got a little solar
panel thing on top.

00:33:13.126 --> 00:33:18.030
I bought 'em, the moles went
away, my yard got even again.

00:33:18.030 --> 00:33:20.700
And then somehow they disappeared.

00:33:20.700 --> 00:33:22.110
They might be under Lincoln's bed

00:33:22.110 --> 00:33:24.150
with a nest full of spoons. I don't know.

00:33:24.150 --> 00:33:25.893
But I had to buy four more.

00:33:26.970 --> 00:33:29.823
It's not poison, it's just a sound.

00:33:30.960 --> 00:33:34.320
So I put, I steaked it out and
yeah, it works like a charm.

00:33:34.320 --> 00:33:38.557
It forces them into my
neighbor's yard, underground.

00:33:40.560 --> 00:33:42.601
But yeah, that's their problem.

