00:34:15.690 --> 00:34:18.450
So it's silence and then it's eeee.

00:34:22.020 --> 00:34:23.820
Eeee.

00:34:23.820 --> 00:34:27.930
So every time I would go outside
it was kind of unsettling.

00:34:27.930 --> 00:34:29.160
You can hear it?

00:34:29.160 --> 00:34:30.693
Yeah. Yeah.

00:34:31.560 --> 00:34:32.699
It's gotta be like that though because-

00:34:32.699 --> 00:34:33.532
It's not ultrasonic.

00:34:33.532 --> 00:34:36.210
Well it says ultrasonic.
It's not freaking ultrasonic.

00:34:36.210 --> 00:34:38.660
I would just call it sonic
because I can hear it.

00:34:40.017 --> 00:34:41.700
It has to cut on and off

00:34:41.700 --> 00:34:45.090
because otherwise they would adjust to it.

00:34:45.090 --> 00:34:46.050
Potentially.

00:34:46.050 --> 00:34:46.883
I don't know.

